XCHPUT (probes/bios/spec/xchput.asm), the CHPUT matrix, run through probes/bios/biosl_run.py on the
NODISK row: the Philips VG-8020 (the main-BIOS reference) against zerobas (C-BIOS repack). CHPUT is
called DIRECTLY by the cartridge. SCREEN 0, width 40 (LINL40 := 40, INITXT, CLS at INIT).
Before every case: CHPUT 'x' 'x', CR, ESC Y row 10 col 19 (0-based), 'P' 'Q' 'R', ESC Y row 10 col 20:
the cursor on the Q (CSRY 11, CSRX 21, 1-based); cells = row 10, columns 19 / 20 / 21 (P Q R before).
Columns: CSRX CSRY A cells (VG-8020) | the same (zerobas). Case n = mode * 256 + v.
LINLEN: VG-8020 40, zerobas 40

== mode 0: CHPUT v ==
